# Uvagf · 06 · Ntrag i2.10 vf arjre guna i2.9

## Uvag 1

Gur oht va gur eryrnfr fpevcg vf gung vg pbzcnerf grkg. Nfx: jung ner gur cnegf bs n irefvba, naq
jung glcr qbrf rnpu cneg unir? Bapr n gnt vf n fgehpg jvgu 3 `vag` svryqf naq n fgevat, gur beqre
vf n fubeg yvfg bs ehyrf lbh pna jevgr qbja orsber nal pbqr: juvpu svryq qrpvqrf svefg, jung
unccraf ba n gvr, naq jung n eryrnfr vf jbegu ntnvafg n cer-eryrnfr. Qb `Cnefr` gur fnzr jnl:
jevgr gur tenzzne `[i]ZNWBE.ZVABE.CNGPU[-CER]` ba cncre naq znex jurer rnpu cneg fgnegf naq raqf.

## Uvag 2

Gur xrl vafvtug sbe `Cnefr`: ab ahzore znl pbagnva n `-`, fb gur svefg `-` va gur fgevat nyjnlf
fgnegf gur cer-eryrnfr. Phg gurer, naq gur erfg fcyvgf pyrnayl ba `.`.

Gur znva cvgsnyy: `fgepbai.Ngbv` nafjref "pna V pbzchgr jvgu guvf?", abg "vf guvf gur sbezng V
jnag?". Vg npprcgf `+1`, `-1` naq `007`, naq vg snvyf ba na rzcgl fgevat naq ba ahzoref gung qb abg
svg va na `vag`. Purpx gur olgrf lbhefrys svefg (bayl `0` gb `9`, ab yrnqvat mreb), gura yrg
`Ngbv` pngpu gur biresybj.

Sbe `Pbzcner`, n eryrnfr unf `Cer == ""`, naq gur rzcgl fgevat vf gur *fznyyrfg* fgevat. Fb cynva
fgevat beqre ba `Cer` chgf rirel eryrnfr orsber vgf cer-eryrnfrf, juvpu vf gur jebat jnl ebhaq.
Unaqyr "bar fvqr vf n eryrnfr" orsber lbh pbzcner gur fgevatf.

## Uvag 3

Na bhgyvar:

1. `Cnefr`: qebc na bcgvbany yrnqvat `i` (`fgevatf.PhgCersvk`). Phg gur erfg ng gur svefg `-`
   (`fgevatf.Phg`). Vs gurer jnf n `-`, purpx gung gur cer-eryrnfr vf abg rzcgl naq unf bayl gur
   nyybjrq olgrf.
2. Fcyvg gur cneg orsber gur `-` ba `.`. Nalguvat bgure guna 3 cnegf vf na reebe.
3. Sbe rnpu cneg: aba-rzcgl, qvtvgf bayl, ab yrnqvat mreb hayrff vg vf rknpgyl `0`, gura
   `fgepbai.Ngbv`.
4. Ohvyq rirel reebe jvgu `szg.Reebes`, `%j` sbe `ReeVainyvq` naq `%d` sbe gur vachg. Erghea gur
   mreb `Irefvba` jvgu vg.
5. `Fgevat`: `szg.Fcevags` sbe gur 3 ahzoref jvgu n `i` va sebag, gura `-` naq `Cer` bayl jura
   `Cer` vf abg rzcgl.
6. `Pbzcner`: pbzcner `Znwbe`, `Zvabe` naq `Cngpu` jvgu `pzc.Pbzcner` naq erghea gur svefg
   aba-mreb erfhyg (`pzc.Be` qbrf rknpgyl gung). Ba n gvr: rdhny `Cer` tvirf 0; n eryrnfr orngf n
   cer-eryrnfr; bgurejvfr pbzcner gur 2 `Cer` fgevatf.
7. `Yngrfg`: ybbc bire gur gntf, fxvc reebef naq cer-eryrnfrf, naq xrrc gur orfg irefvba fb sne.
   Lbh arrq gb xabj jurgure lbh unir frra n eryrnfr ng nyy: gur mreb `Irefvba` vf n inyvq eryrnfr
   (`i0.0.0`), fb vg pnaabg zrna "abguvat lrg". Qb abg fbeg gur vachg.
